- Reviewed TM4C129E_DriverLib/xApplication_MCU/Core/SYSTICK/xSource/SYSTICK_Init.c and TM4C129E_DriverLib/xApplication_MCU/Core/SYSTICK/xSource/SYSTICK_Calibration.c.
- Confirmed SYSTICK__enInitUsVector() computes uxTick_Sysclk once through SYSTICK__enGetTickCountUs().
